  |\varphi \> = \bigoplus_{j\in {\rm Irr} (U^{\otimes N})} \sqrt{\frac{p_j}{d_j}}  |I_j\kk  \in \widetilde{\hilb H}
  ~,\end{equation} 
where $p_j$ are probabilities, the index $j$ runs over the set ${\rm Irr} (U^{\otimes N})$
 of all irreducible representations  $\{U_j\}$ contained in the decomposition of $\{U^{\otimes N}\}$, and $\widetilde{\hilb H} = \bigoplus_{j\in {\rm Irr} (U^{\otimes N}) } (\hilb H_j \otimes \hilb
H_j)$ is a subspace of $\hilb H_o \otimes \hilb H_i$ carrying the
representation $\widetilde{U} = \bigoplus_{j\in {\rm Irr (U^{\otimes N})}}( U_j \otimes I_{j})$,  $I_j$ being the identity in $\hilb H_j$.

