src:
Normalizing the Yukawa couplings of the neutral bosons to a fermion $f$  by $m_f/v$ where $v=\sqrt{v_1^2+v_2^2} = 246$ GeV, we have the following Yukawa terms:
\begin{eqnarray}
-{\cal L}^{\rm 2HDMs}_{\rm Yukawa} &=&
\sum_{f=u,d,l} {m_f\over v}
\left( y_f^h h \bar{f} f + y_f^H H \bar{f} f - i y_f^A A \bar{f} \gamma_5 f \right) \\
&& \nonumber
+\left[ \sqrt{2} V_{ud} H^+  \bar{u} \left( {m_u\over v} y^A_u P_L  + {m_d \over v} y^d_A P_R\right) d
+\sqrt{2} {m_l \over v} y_l^A H^+ \bar{\nu} P_R l + h.c.\right]
\end{eqnarray}
where the normalized Yukawa coupligs $y^{h,H,A}_f$ are summarized in Table I for each of these four types of 2HDMs.

