	||\omega||_{\beta}=||\omega||_{\infty}+||D^{\beta}\omega||_{\infty},
	\end{align*}
	where $||.||_{\infty}$ is the supremum norm defined on the class of continuous functions. 	This space will be denoted by $C^{\beta}([0,T]).$

