linearly $\{x\}$ and $\{ y \}$, so to have the maximum correlation
with $\{z\}$. The generic linear combination, 
\begin{equation}
\vec{k} = { \vec{x} + b \vec{y} \over \sqrt{1 + b^2 + 2 b\ \vec{x} \cdot
\vec{y} }}
\end{equation}

